===== opening conversation {"type": "tts", "text": "Hello, this is Freya Bank's digital assistant calling, and this call is recorded. Am I speaking with {{title}} {{last_name}}?"}
You have just said: "Hello, this is Freya Bank's digital assistant calling, and this call is recorded. Am I speaking with {{title}} {{last_name}}?"
